Spaedrich dragon blue~
Spaedrich, the blue dragon~
A massive blue dragon rests quietly here, pointedly ignoring you.
~
The blue dragon stretches her massive wings as she absorbs the warmth from the
sands beneath her. The suns have made her scales a glistening sapphire colour
that sparkles against the light and gives her an almost holy appearance. Her
wingspan is easily one hundred feet, nearly matching her incredible length.
~
